<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-SIDOTI WINS WORLD WOMEN 10 KMS WALK TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-SIDOTI WINS WORLD WOMEN 10 KMS WALK TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Annarita Sidoti won the world women's 10 kms walk gold medal on Thursday.</p>
<p>Russian Olimpiada Ivanova took the silver and Olga Kardopoltseva of Belarus the bronze.</p>
</text>
